{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_01",
  "title": "扉页所见",
  "storyCode": "EA-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "50d638aa395eb0608b31badd1c5626196c3e7835458205a666e4ae95e997c092",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）......抱歉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士，请留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，苇草，是你！你之前突然离席，我还以为是我们的招待有什么不周到的地方呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不，我很感谢你们的款待，只是当时突然想起还有事。现在我还有一些问题，能请您为我解答吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，你问吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道自己身上正燃烧着火焰吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火？你是说祝福？真奇怪，你居然能看见其他人身上的祝福？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我也是被人提醒，这才意识到的——\n等等，你是说，你知道，但你们都看不见？这怎么可能呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "居民将手伸向自己腰间。\n为了驱散沼泽中的黑雾，塔拉人的祖先会在腰间挎上一朵以源石技艺固定住的小小的火焰。\n这样的习俗在维多利亚彻底掌控塔拉后被严令禁止。\n时移世异，不必再顾及维多利亚禁令的塔拉人，至少是纳斯尔纱人，选择在腰间挎上小巧的源石灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也知道燃料不够，加上宵禁存在，所以源石灯我们开不起，也不必开。不过......只要像这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是她的火......在这灯上显出了颜色......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在城里人一开灯就是这个颜色，换了别的颜色的元器件也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们难道不担心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也看到了，现在纳斯尔纱一切向好，所以这只能是红龙的祝福，不会有别的解释了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是？\n可是一个鲁莽的归乡者，要告诉她这火的存在与不祥勾连？她不会相信的。\n也许直接一些的办法反而会奏效，拉芙希妮在心中如此祈祷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我也想感受一下“红龙的祝福”，所以......我能握一下您的手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你都进城了，城市里的人迟早会得到的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是个小小的心愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，特意回到塔拉来，你也不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，你是做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我会一些医疗手段，我的源石技艺可以辅助我，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来你是个医生，城里正需要医生呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来吧，让我们握手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她握紧女人掌心结着老茧的手，同时让火从自己的手腕处向着对方蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她闭上眼。\n闭上眼，去回忆那些曾被自己抚平痛苦，不再被迫滞留人世的对象——\n去温暖这冰冷的火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紫色的火逐渐褪去。在那之下，苍白的、摇曳着友善笑容的面庞慢慢清晰起来。\n于是她试图将更多紫色的部分消去，却没能及时看见女人面色陡变的一瞬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的手——你对我的手做了什么？我的手没知觉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "还有我的祝福，也感受不到了！你到底在做什么？\n放开我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守灵人”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草小姐，请先放开这位可怜的女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这位苇草小姐没有恶意，我以我的人格担保。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可她说她是医生，医生怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "基于源石技艺的医术偶尔也会有一些副作用。看，你的手，这不是好好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我还是感觉不到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您不会有事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "离群的守灵人抬手，以温热的掌心轻抚受惊女人的前额。并不是什么奇异的动作，女人却逐渐安定下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好，我相信你。是的，我的手还在，祝福也还在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夜幕就要降临，还是尽快回到房屋之中吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草小姐，您也还有另一场宴会要参加，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "宴会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯，宴会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，现在，请允许我为您引路离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守灵人”，既然你回来了，那代表莫兰他们已经安顿下来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，他们会住在遗迹略微外围一点的地方。这个时间，大概还在清扫遗迹旁那些没人的小屋吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“守灵人”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用。要说的话，我更希望您能称呼我为“涅梅丝”，因为我如今的工作已与守灵人相去甚远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，涅梅丝。你刚刚说到宴会......谁要举办宴会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "几天之后，深池会开一场庆功会，所有高层的人物都会参加，爱布拉娜殿下也在其中。我最近就在忙这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "庆功会？在居民们用土豆充当“炖肉”和“烤鳞”的时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "土豆的事一开始是因为匮乏，后来人们就只是......\n习惯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但深池也知道城里的情况，说是宴会，至少我没在清单上看到什么吃喝的环节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是在替谁粉饰，拉芙希妮小姐。我相信深池不会做出那种置塔拉人于不顾的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，拉芙希妮小姐，我得先离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她走得急匆匆的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果直接祛除紫火会引发恐慌，那么，假如在大家不知情的情况下，去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "背后的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去把你想要的东西抓在手里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高尚的红龙转过身去，看到一个明晃晃地燃烧着紫火的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不，如果说城里其他的居民“沾染”了火焰，面前这个人倒不如说是紫火凝结成的一样，看似毫不炽烈，却连周身的光线都扭曲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜，你想要的东西无聊透顶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟塔拉的火焰已经染上了颜色，这是既定事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道火的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碰巧知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请把你知道的事情告诉我。这很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告诉你？凭什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我需要阻止人们被紫火吞没。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后换上你自己的火，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要这一城人能够安然无恙，火焰的颜色并不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么冠冕堂皇的废话，简直都让人怀念起来了，红龙。你这借口拙劣到好笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，你和我姐姐......有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮向前踏出一步，那身影也往后退了一步，和她保持着距离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "关系？你，你的姐姐，还有我，我们本性相同，我们都渴望权力、争斗、残杀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们都对接下来要发生的事情摩拳擦掌，恨不得立刻就用火把一切烧光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这次我弃权。在这座巢穴被火焰焚尽之前，我会为你们两边同时助威的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“放逐王”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再见了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红龙试图将生命的火焰编织成牢笼，但在牢笼成型之前，那身影就被风吹散。\n火只是短暂地照亮了那影子长长的尾巴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而后归于虚无。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你呀。怎么了，这种时候跑来见我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别告诉我你的粮店又出了什么岔子要我管。我从来没把你当下属，我们是“生意伙伴”，懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白就好。我这儿又有一批货需要你押出城。一会儿就出发，宵禁之前回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷，我说的就是这个——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前运出城的那些谷物......您说过不影响城内正常粮食供应的，可现在大家还是只能吃土豆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你知道塔拉其他地方什么样吗？他们连土豆都没得吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "纳斯尔纱的农产品产量已经很高了，事急从权，我们是在帮助自己的同胞，懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，光是上次那几车大麦，你就从里面赚了多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退一万步讲，纳斯尔纱人也不是没得吃了，起码土豆还能填饱肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更不用说农业地块很快就能收获，到时候多的是新的粮食，我还怕你的粮店卖不出去呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过呢，我也不喜欢勉强。如果你实在过意不去，那就把你的经营许可转让掉，粮店也别开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我吃什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都说了，你不是我下属。我为什么要管生意伙伴吃什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，一会儿把许可交上来吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，老爷，别！我愿意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还站在这儿不走干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有一件事，我听朋友说，林中的黑雾最近可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑雾？如果连这都需要你来提醒，那我也不用干了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "像往常一样，出城门之后自然有人接应，剩下的事用不着你操心。走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？早上“校官”来巡查的时候，那家伙说什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，“校官”大人上午没来。领袖派他做别的事情去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你这么慌里慌张的做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是南部的农业地块已经正式进入收获期了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是好事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，但，那个，毕竟城里的熟练农业工人都不在了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗐，手册上怎么说，你们就怎么做，明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，整个地块产量预估有多少？报给我，到时候我整合一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们也是头回做这种工作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没用的东西！庄稼熟没熟都看不出来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熟肯定是熟了，不然我们也不可能收......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不就是一切正常吗？按往年的正常产量报！回去回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好，我是游牧人布莉吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在纳斯尔纱城里的信都送完了。我想去纳斯尔纱的最高点，让风把我的消息带给我的兄弟姐妹们，然后我就离开城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我想起来了，是你啊。来了这么多次，我们哪次都没放你上去，怎么还不长记性？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就连维多利亚人在这里的时候，他们也允许我到堡垒的高处去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你觉得我是维多利亚人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你是塔拉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你就该知道，都是塔拉人，我们就没必要再惯着你们那些老掉牙的臭毛病。什么游牧人啊守灵人啊，装神弄鬼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烦躁的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赶紧走！再不走，小心我把你逮起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......走就走，有什么好生气的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了送信，一件事也没做成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，至少赶在宵禁之前出城了，现在只需要穿过黑林，回到原野上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，但愿林中的黑雾会让我过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过黑雾一向不阻拦游牧人的，我担心这个干什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "游牧人踢了一脚路边的落叶，让沙沙的声响回荡在眼前空旷的深林里。\n出乎她的意料，这声音并未逐渐停下，而是形成了反复的回音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布莉吉于是猛地蹲下身去，试图捂住眼前那些散碎的叶片。声音正从那里传来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起，不该踢你们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "回音仍未停止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这声浪不仅没有停止，甚至回响得越来越大，越来越大，直至变成令人难以忍受，震耳欲聋的噪音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "与此同时，黑雾从她的脚边漫上来，捂上她的眼睛，堵住她的耳朵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到她发现自己又回到了黑林的入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......第五次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不打算放我离开，非要让我回城里去，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，我不会回去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大不了去黑林外边搭个帐篷对付几晚，总有我能离开的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
